                <head>58. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On December 12, the General Assembly adopted without vote Resolution 1325 (XIII)
                    admitting the Republic of Guinea to membership in the United Nations. For text,
                    see U.N. doc. A/4090, page 60. For a record of the proceedings, see U.N. doc.
                    A/PV.789.</p>
            </div>
